OL,3,GNEWSAMan pleads guilty to murder of
OL,4,Awoman found drowned
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has pleaded guilty to the murder
OL,7,Fof a woman who was found dead in the
OL,8,FRiver Thames in Oxfordshire.
OL,10,FNelio Gouveia, 45, of Phyllis Court
OL,11,FDrive, Henley-on-Thames, required a
OL,12,FPortuguese interpreter when he entered
OL,13,Fhis plea at Oxford Crown Court.
OL,15,FThe body of Jennifer Symonds, 44, was
OL,16,Frecovered from the river at Phyllis
OL,17,FCourt Club early on 6 March. A
OL,18,Fpost-mortem examination showed she died
OL,19,Ffrom drowning.
OL,21,FGouveia, who was known to Symonds, will
OL,22,Fbe sentenced on 20 November.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
